                <pb facs="0007" n="III" xml:id="pgIII"/>

                <head>Preface</head>
                <p>This volume was compiled and edited under the supervision of S. Everett Gleason,
                    Chief of the Foreign Relations Division.</p>
                <p>The documentation on the relations of the United States with Bulgaria,
                    Czechoslovakia, Hungary, Poland, Romania, and Yugoslavia was compiled by William
                    Slany.</p>
                <p>The compilations on Finland and the Soviet Union were the work of Rogers P.
                    Churchill.</p>
                <p>The Publishing and Reproduction Services Division (Jerome H. Perlmutter, Chief)
                    was responsible for the technical editing of this volume.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">William</hi> M. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Franklin</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Director, Historical Office<lb/>Bureau of Public
                        Affairs</hi>
                    <lb/><dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1971-10-15"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >October</hi> 15, 1971</date></dateline></closer>


                <xi:include href="preface-a1.xml" xpointer="preface-a1"/>
